	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Non eram dignus, ut vestrum aliquis <placeName ref="l582">Zofingę</placeName> me conveniret<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Wegen plötzlich aufgebrochener Spannungen zwischen <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> und den <placeName ref="l2448">V Orten</placeName> war <persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName> nicht zum verabredeten Treffen erschienen, vgl. oben <ref target="file10607">Nr. 569</ref>, 1-8.</note>, qui non sine periculo valetudinarii <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>corporis illuc redintegrandę amicicię gratia concesseram, nec ab eo tempore dignus fui vel a te <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>unicum accipere iota.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Si mea culpa id factum scirem, dolorem certe mihi gravissimum adferret, at <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>cum mihi bene conscius sim de utroque vestrum, cogor tam absentiam quam silentium susque deque ferre <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et in angulo meo meos exanclare labores.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p5497">Franciscus</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p5497">Franz Kolb</persName>.</note> amplius prae ingenti struma<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> strunna.</note> officio fungi <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>facile non potest, unde alio symmista indigebimus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Cuius gratia vestro consilio cum opus esset, non potui <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nec meum communicare nec a vobis exigere, nisi prius animo excident in universum, quod occasione <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>neglecta votis meis erga te imprimis potin non potui.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName>, ipso ascensionis die 35.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Tuus <persName ref="p1391">Bert. H.</persName></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>fratri suo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
